{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/10/16/itm_9a173d46c7216564/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.20563","category_id":"llm-agent","collected_at":"2026-10-16T02:44:26Z","content_hash":"4bb735755bfa82607c7d508e0d5c4cddbdf4b8b6987a0f898a751702d4fc8057","evidence":[{"label":"arXiv abstract and submission metadata","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.20563"},{"label":"Full paper PDF","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2610.20563"}],"external_id":"arXiv:2610.20563v1","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T02:44:26Z","fingerprint":"4bb735755bfa82607c7d508e0d5c4cddbdf4b8b6987a0f898a751702d4fc8057","id":"itm_9a173d46c7216564","item_id":"itm_9a173d46c7216564","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-10-14T17:49:37Z","sort_at":"2026-10-14T17:49:37Z","source_id":"arxiv-forgetting-2026","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"论文研究长程自动研究 Agent 为何会因会话与候选历史累积而平台化：作者周期性保留自动评测器验证的全局最优候选、清除四个 Agent 的会话和搜索状态，再从空上下文继续。在 AHC014、Frontier-CS、VLIW kernel 与 nanochat 四项任务、等模型等总预算和每配置三次重复下，遗忘团队平均比四并行高10%、比单 Agent 高22%，单项相对并行最高15%；同状态对照中团队遗忘提升9.2%且花费15.32美元，继续仅1.4%且花费24.67美元。局限是仅验证一个框架/模型、四个可自动评分任务，且无法证明遗忘适用于需要完整审计、长反馈或不可逆动作的研究。","tags":["llm-agent","autoresearch","multi-agent","context-management","search"],"title":"Scaling Discovery Requires Forgetting","title_hash":"2f5f543b364ab5b8b6b8abbec83256bf13f4c3d76114d7a2598a3657bd81c36a","type":"paper","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.20563"}
